abstract: >-
  EdgeSentinel VisionOps is an open-source edge vision Agent Harness for
  NVIDIA Jetson Nano. It integrates real-time video analytics, structured
  event evidence, bounded tool use, a read-only MCP server, online and offline
  model modes, security policy enforcement, observability, and disaster
  recovery in a verifiable self-hosted system.
